            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/7c8ddb489f355747dc4416703296b5b4.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, it is essential to act as a team: coordinate your actions, share information about the enemy, and help your allies to complete combat objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle together with friends, or find new ones right in the game. Join clans, build your community, and climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/a63d8973027d8d596f74c1a477e9e42b.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caliber features over 70 special forces operators from all over the world divided into four classes: Assault, Support, Medic, and Marksman. Each operator has his own unique ability and equipment. Guns, mines, drones, robots, RPGs — use anything to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/6eb96fb0710ffdd49ff9942c248ec6bf.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons in Caliber feel different. Each weapon has its own parameters: damage, spread, rate of fire, bullet velocity, and a number of other characteristics that affect its behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/494607c6d212fd3893f2d997a7eaebf1.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in competitive modes against other players, take victory from players and bots both, or relax with easy and entertaining co-op missions. There is a game mode for everyone — the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles take place on dozens of different maps in various theaters of war: from Middle Eastern Karkhad to the frosty Isverden Archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/7c8ddb489f355747dc4416703296b5b4.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, it is essential to act as a team: coordinate your actions, share information about the enemy, and help your allies to complete combat objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle together with friends, or find new ones right in the game. Join clans, build your community, and climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/d7eca10173e4c5ed0fd404e3856a14ab.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/a63d8973027d8d596f74c1a477e9e42b.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caliber features over 70 special forces operators from all over the world divided into four classes: Assault, Support, Medic, and Marksman. Each operator has his own unique ability and equipment. Guns, mines, drones, robots, RPGs — use anything to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/9ecb48bffabf5d85e79d780756973788.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/6eb96fb0710ffdd49ff9942c248ec6bf.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons in Caliber feel different. Each weapon has its own parameters: damage, spread, rate of fire, bullet velocity, and a number of other characteristics that affect its behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/817ec3d9d88ac0a79c9120121abf284b.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/494607c6d212fd3893f2d997a7eaebf1.avif?t=1793093442\" width=596 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in competitive modes against other players, take victory from players and bots both, or relax with easy and entertaining co-op missions. There is a game mode for everyone — the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles take place on dozens of different maps in various theaters of war: from Middle Eastern Karkhad to the frosty Isverden Archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.poster.avif?t=1793093442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.webm?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/307950/extras/05a6015bc203ee76abdd79bb94143452.mp4?t=1793093442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
